    {
      "id": "claim_1dc412bc88734304a721639f5a255f43",
      "statement": "Reports.jsx renders four independent ReportTable components, one per descriptor in the REPORTS array, and each ReportTable fetches its own report endpoint inside a useEffect with its own rows and error state, so one report failing to load does not block the others.",
